silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_1#mittensforgefactorizationsquare silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeFactorizationSquare is In section 'Bridge to the Yoneda Lemma Paper' the bare symbol ForgeRuntimeAtom anchors to MittensForgeFactorizationSquare: The commutative square: manifest hom-profile (top edge) equals trace fingerprint (bottom edge) under the forge factorization; if it fails to commute, the source is rejected at admission." .
